&lt;p&gt;From: Lorin Chandler, To: Elijah H. Chandler and Family&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Patono, Kansas on June 21, 1919&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mrs. E.H. Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Ill&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patono, Kan 6/21/19&lt;br&gt;
Dear Folks,&lt;br&gt;
On our way to Wichita. Left McLune at 8:40 both feeling fine, will write later.&lt;br&gt;
Love,&lt;br&gt;
Lorin&lt;/p&gt;</description>
